:{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"全部通过后 Phase 3 验收完成。附件内阅读、可执行 Notebook、内置 CLI 服务和发布仍属于后续工作。","position":{"start":{"line":29,"column":1},"end":{"line":29,"column":1}},"key":"u9O2P0NaCf"}],"key":"AKoDuJXGej"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resource tools update (1.8.1) / 资源工具更新","position":{"start":{"line":31,"column":1},"end":{"line":31,"column":1}},"key":"zFp10Y8gqZ"}],"identifier":"resource-tools-update-1-8-1","label":"Resource tools update (1.8.1) / 资源工具更新","html_id":"resource-tools-update-1-8-1","implicit":true,"key":"V31rLdUpou"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Same-name imports now ask: Replace existing updates ALL references to the managed resource; Keep both adds a numbered display name; Cancel imports nothing. Physical filenames remain hashes.","position":{"start":{"line":33,"column":1},"end":{"line":33,"column":1}},"key":"JMfeUydSi1"}],"key":"RxeKfwlMvA"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resources → Show resources separates ordinary Notes from Books. Select one Book, one ordinary note, or Unreferenced; use the checkboxes and Delete selected for a batch. Delete checks references across the entire workspace, including other Books and Book logos, before asking for confirmation. Removing Markdown links retains resources. Confirmed resource deletion removes the managed file permanently; source links are left unchanged and will show missing-resource notices. Shared identical bytes stay on disk while another resource record still needs them. Original imported files and previously exported Books are unaffected. Attachment reading remains a future feature.","position":{"start":{"line":35,"column":1},"end":{"line":35,"column":1}},"key":"k3TKPTrfSP"}],"key":"INgxqhJ40X"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"同名导入现在弹出三个选项：Replace existing 替换所有原引用使用的资源；Keep both 给新资源显示名添加 (2)、(3) 等序号；Cancel 取消。磁盘继续使用哈希文件名。","position":{"start":{"line":37,"column":1},"end":{"line":37,"column":1}},"key":"NJKxLo4eam"}],"key":"JPjUBxqI77"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resources → Show resources 区分普通 Notes 和 Books，可选某本书、某篇普通笔记或 Unreferenced（未引用）。勾选资源后点击 Delete selected 批量删除，单个资源也有 Delete。删除提示检查整个工作区的引用，包括其他书籍及书籍图标。仅删除正文链接会保留资源；确认永久删除资源才清除托管文件，正文中的旧链接不会自动改写，会提示资源缺失。若另一条资源记录仍共用相同文件，该文件会保留至最后一条记录被删除。电脑上的原始导入文件和已经导出的 Book 不受影响。软件内附件阅读留待后续开发。","position":{"start":{"line":39,"column":1},"end":{"line":39,"column":1}},"key":"dYhaACFHo6"}],"key":"yAlz7VQBJh"}],"key":"aBpMN8g1UD"}],"key":"Ucne2V1t9I"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Citations and Bibliographies","url":"/citations","group":"LanCarbon Guide"},"next":{"title":"Phase 4 Reference","url":"/index-5","group":"LanCarbon Guide"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}